const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"研究问题",en:"Research question"},body:{zh:"论文使用朴素贝叶斯方法分析10-K和10-Q中MD&A的前瞻性陈述，并将语调度量与后续基本面关联。 阅读时应将其放回原始样本、时点和制度环境中理解，不能把问题本身当作跨市场结论。",en:"The article examines forward-looking statements in MD&A sections of 10-K and 10-Q filings using a Naïve Bayesian classification approach and relates measured tone to later fundamentals. Read it as a bounded question, not as a conclusion that automatically travels beyond its sample, dates, or institutional setting."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1475-679x.2010.00382.x",label:{zh:"Journal of Accounting Research · DOI record · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Accounting Research · DOI record · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"研究设计",en:"Research design"},body:{zh:"它定义文本语料、分类程序、语调指标和会计结果；文本选择、标签构造、披露时间和控制变量均不可脱离。 比较对象、观察窗口和对照关系共同构成研究合同；改变其中任一选择，可能改变所检验的命题。",en:"It defines a filing-text corpus, classification procedure, tone measure, and accounting outcomes; text selection, label construction, filing time, and controls are integral to the result. The comparison, observation window, and control relation are part of the research contract; changing one can change the proposition being tested."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1475-679x.2010.00382.x",label:{zh:"Journal of Accounting Research · DOI record · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Accounting Research · DOI record · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"数据与时点",en:"Data and timing"},body:{zh:"需要版本化披露文本、披露与修订时间、MD&A边界、句子或文档标签、公司标识、会计结果、使用时的收益，以及可审计的词典或分类器版本。 字段定义、可得时点和样本筛选必须与原研究分开记录，不能因变量同名或使用最新修订值便视为可比。",en:"Inputs require versioned filing text, filing and amendment timestamps, MD&A boundaries, sentence or document labels, firm identifiers, accounting outcomes, returns where used, and an auditable vocabulary or classifier version. Keep fields, availability timing, and sample filters separate from the original study: a same-named variable or later-revised database is not automatically comparable."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1475-679x.2010.00382.x",label:{zh:"Journal of Accounting Research · DOI record · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Accounting Research · DOI record · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"如何理解结果",en:"How to read the result"},body:{zh:"来源在论文定义的前瞻性语调度量中发现信息内容，不会验证通用词典、推断管理层意图或保证单份披露文件的前景。 它只支持来源描述的经验或理论关系，不能把相关性、模型拟合或历史表现升级为因果、可执行性或未来保证。",en:"The source finds information in its defined forward-looking tone measure under the paper's design; it does not validate generic dictionaries, infer managerial intent, or certify a particular filing's outlook. This remains the empirical or theoretical relation described by the source; it does not turn association, fit, or historical performance into causality, an executable procedure, or a future guarantee."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1475-679x.2010.00382.x",label:{zh:"Journal of Accounting Research · DOI record · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Accounting Research · DOI record · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"复核清单",en:"Replication checks"},body:{zh:"使用分析时点可获得的披露；保留修订和文档分区；记录预处理和词典；隔离标签与训练；检验实体映射；明确会计结果时点。 开展后续分析前，应将这些选择写入版本化研究记录，并保留原始来源链接与访问日期。",en:"Use the filing available at the analysis date; preserve amendments and document sections; record preprocessing and vocabulary; separate labels from training; test entity mapping; and keep accounting outcome timing explicit. Before extending the analysis, record these choices in a versioned note and retain the primary-source link and access date."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1475-679x.2010.00382.x",label:{zh:"Journal of Accounting Research · DOI record · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Accounting Research · DOI record · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"适用边界",en:"Scope boundary"},body:{zh:"该条导读引用 Journal of Accounting Research · DOI record。文本指标是受选择、语言和时点误差影响的代理变量，不是法律或投资建议，也不能替代阅读原始文件。 如需数值结论、参数、表格或稳健性检验，请回到原文并单独核对版本、附录与样本定义。",en:"This guide cites Journal of Accounting Research · DOI record. Text-derived measures are proxies subject to selection, language, and timing error; they are not legal advice, investment advice, or a substitute for reading the underlying filing. For numerical conclusions, parameters, tables, or robustness tests, return to the original and separately verify the edition, appendices, and sample definitions."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1475-679x.2010.00382.x",label:{zh:"Journal of Accounting Research · DOI record · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Accounting Research · DOI record · source description"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"本文只整理“The Information Content of Forward-Looking Statements in Corporate Filings—A Naïve Bayesian Machine Learning Approach”公开说明的研究对象、设计与适用边界，不构成收益预测、交易规则或全文复现。文本指标是受选择、语言和时点误差影响的代理变量，不是法律或投资建议，也不能替代阅读原始文件。",en:"This guide only organizes the publicly described question and design of “The Information Content of Forward-Looking Statements in Corporate Filings—A Naïve Bayesian Machine Learning Approach”. It is not a return forecast, trading rule, or full-text replication. The source's stated scope remains controlling."}};export{e as default};
